        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "editorMode": "code",
          "expr": "disk_root_bytes",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "{{root}}"
        }
      ],
      "description": "Top-level folders on the data disk, from `du`, which counts each inode once per run. A hardlinked\nfile therefore lands in whichever folder du walks first rather than being counted in both.\n\nFolders double-count: an import is a hardlink, so a film is under films/ and under downloads/ at once. \"Disk by why it is there\" below counts each byte once."
    },
